#: includes/class-wc-category-donations-admin.php:449
msgid ""
"SoftfactorIA Category Donations for WooCommerce adds a donation percentage "
"and a cause to each product category. The donation amount is calculated on "
"the product price before taxes, recorded with the order, and adjusted "
"automatically when orders are refunded or cancelled."
msgstr ""
"SoftfactorIA Category Donations for WooCommerce engade unha porcentaxe de "
"doazón e unha causa a cada categoría de produto. O importe da doazón "
"calcúlase sobre o prezo do produto sen impostos, rexístrase co pedido e "
"axústase automaticamente cando os pedidos se reembolsan ou cancelan."

#: includes/class-wc-category-donations-admin.php:452
msgid ""
"The Donations tab shows the recorded totals (per category, per year and "
"overall), the list of cancelled donations, and lets you download an annual "
"CSV report. The customer donations summary appears on the user edit screen, "
"and the Settings tab controls the default percentage and the donation "
"message."
msgstr ""
"A pestana Doazóns amosa os totais rexistrados (por categoría, por ano e "
"global), a lista de doazóns canceladas e permite descargar un informe anual "
"en CSV. O resumo de doazóns do cliente aparece na pantalla de edición de "
"usuario, e a pestana Axustes controla a porcentaxe por defecto e a mensaxe "
"de doazón."

#: includes/class-wc-category-donations-admin.php:455
msgid ""
"Shortcodes and public functions let themes display donation information "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Os shortcodes e funcións públicas permiten amosar información das doazóns en "
"calquera parte do tema."

#: includes/class-wc-category-donations-admin.php:456
msgid "See the shortcodes tab."
msgstr "Ver a pestana de shortcodes."

